T* (transaction architecture exhibits critical exposure at the intersection of syndicate structure and regulatory) Tj
T* (standards: equity commitments and the $291.93M Parent Termination Fee limited guarantees are several and) Tj
T* (not joint, leaving Option Care without recourse against the non-defaulting sponsor if either party fails to fund.) Tj
